=== PARITY (vs web PillFilterBar.tsx) ===
  Data sources (web → native P1/S8 source seam):
    items / activeKey / onChange / ariaLabel / variant / scrollable props (parent-owned)
        → PillFilterSource → PillFilterInput (+ select() = web onChange peer)
    useId (stable tablist id)               → native view identity / @FocusState (NOT a fetch)
    (source is "anonymous" — no useTranslation) → native chrome via PillFilterStrings (P1/S10)
  Verbatim web logic ported + unit-pinned:
    count suffix `({fmtInt(item.count)})`   → PillFilterNumber.int + "(%@)" (locale grouping) ·
    handleKeyDown: enabledKeys = items.filter(!disabled).map(key); ArrowLeft/Right wrap
      `(idx+delta+n)%n`; Home→first; End→last; `idx===-1` (active pill disabled) → no move ·
    `accent ?? 'cyan'` default.
  Composition (pills / tabs both reproduced):
    pills → rounded-full Capsule chip + active fill (accent .15) + ring (accent .40) + leading
      6pt accent dot · tabs → flat + 2pt accent bottom underline + container hairline ·
    selected text = accent; unselected = textMuted; disabled = opacity 0.4 + skipped in nav;
    leading icon (SF Symbol peer of web `icon?: ReactNode`); trailing muted tabular `(N)`.
  Accent palette → design tokens (NO raw hex): cyan→accent, green→statusSuccess,
    amber→statusWarning, red→statusDanger, purple→chartSeriesPower, blue→chartSeriesSpeed.
  States (all render, never a blank box): loading(skeleton chips) · empty(web empty `tablist`
    → labeled "No filters available") · error(+retry, leaf add) · data(row) · stale(chip+banner
    +one auto-refresh) · offline(cached+chip) — a freshness envelope (ADR-013) around the
    controlled web row.
